{"script": "scenario_miu_route01_12.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 0, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "因為至少星期日讓櫻乃多睡一會的想法，我一個人出門前往社團。", "text_idx": 344, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 29, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route01_12.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 1, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "睡眠不足是女孩子的大敵。", "text_idx": 378, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 12, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route01_12.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 2, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "……不過櫻乃實在太常在我房間爆睡，應該是不用擔心啦。", "text_idx": 259, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 26, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route01_12.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 3, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "每次我以為她在看漫畫，一回頭就發現她躺在床上睡著了。", "text_idx": 371, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 26, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route01_12.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 4, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "更不用說現在這個季節真的很好睡了。", "text_idx": 366, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 17, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route01_12.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 5, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「嘎！？」", "text_idx": 293, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 5, "alt_speaker": "紗凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 380, "voice": "sn0827", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route01_12.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 6, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「……早安，乾同學。」", "text_idx": 265, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 11, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 363, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route01_12.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 7, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "雖然她的第一反應是那樣，我還是打了招呼。", "text_idx": 393, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 20, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route01_12.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 8, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "她的驚訝反應比電視上的綜藝咖有過之而無不及。", "text_idx": 348, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 22, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route01_12.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 9, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「一大早就糟透了。」", "text_idx": 268, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 10, "alt_speaker": "紗凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 380, "voice": "sn0828", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route01_12.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 10, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「抱歉讓妳不開心了。」", "text_idx": 307, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 11, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 363, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route01_12.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 11, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「不是說了今天休息嗎？為什麼你一副要去社團的樣子啊？」", "text_idx": 270, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 27, "alt_speaker": "紗凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 380, "voice": "sn0829", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route01_12.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 12, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「因為有點在意動物們。而且今天美羽學姊也要打工吧。」", "text_idx": 296, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 26, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 363, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route01_12.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 13, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「學姊的打工是從下午開始。我想說上午可以跟她親親熱熱的說。」", "text_idx": 299, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 30, "alt_speaker": "紗凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 380, "voice": "sn0830", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route01_12.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 14, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "所以她看到我才這麼不爽啊。", "text_idx": 362, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 13, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route01_12.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 15, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "……不對，乾同學是隨時都在對我不爽。", "text_idx": 258, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 18, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route01_12.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 16, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "不過，能像這樣並肩行走已經算稍有進步了吧。", "text_idx": 326, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 21, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route01_12.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 17, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「而且今天……」", "text_idx": 315, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 8, "alt_speaker": "紗凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 380, "voice": "sn0831", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route01_12.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 18, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「嗯？今天怎麼了嗎？」", "text_idx": 292, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 11, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 363, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route01_12.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 19, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「…………」", "text_idx": 262, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 6, "alt_speaker": "紗凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 380, "voice": "sn0832", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route01_12.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 20, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "這一天，我們野放了２隻松鼠回歸大自然。", "text_idx": 386, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 19, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route01_12.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 21, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "我們社團的目的並不是飼育動物。", "text_idx": 356, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 15, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route01_12.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 22, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "而是救助動物讓牠們恢復建康，並且回到原本的生活環境。", "text_idx": 383, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 26, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route01_12.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 23, "speaker": "みう", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「抱歉喔，讓你們在這麼狹窄的籠子待了這麼久。」", "text_idx": 306, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 23, "alt_speaker": "美羽", "alt_speaker_idx": 381, "voice": "mu0773", "char_id": "みう"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route01_12.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 24, "speaker": "みう", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「不可以再回來這裡囉……」", "text_idx": 269, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 13, "alt_speaker": "美羽", "alt_speaker_idx": 381, "voice": "mu0774", "char_id": "みう"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route01_12.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 25, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "這兩隻松鼠是受傷躺在路邊時被學姊撿到的。", "text_idx": 387, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 20, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route01_12.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 26, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "牠們身旁的松鼠媽媽已經死去。", "text_idx": 375, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 14, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route01_12.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 27, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "今後牠們必須自己面對嚴酷的大自然。", "text_idx": 332, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 17, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route01_12.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 28, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "沒有人能幫助牠們。", "text_idx": 373, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 9, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route01_12.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 29, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "但是，那裡也有著無盡的自由。", "text_idx": 335, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 14, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route01_12.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 30, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「唔……」", "text_idx": 283, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 5, "alt_speaker": "紗凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 380, "voice": "sn0833", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route01_12.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 31, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "和帶著笑容目送松鼠們的美羽學姊相比，乾同學正拼命忍住眼淚。", "text_idx": 342, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 29, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route01_12.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 32, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "她平常就很照顧兩隻松鼠，牠們也很親近她。", "text_idx": 347, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 20, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route01_12.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 33, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「乾同學，請用。」", "text_idx": 273, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 9, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 363, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route01_12.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 34, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "我遞出手帕，乾同學立刻背對我。", "text_idx": 360, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 15, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route01_12.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 35, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "但是她拿走了手帕。", "text_idx": 333, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 9, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route01_12.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 36, "speaker": "みう", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「走吧，回去吧。」", "text_idx": 317, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 9, "alt_speaker": "美羽", "alt_speaker_idx": 381, "voice": "mu0775", "char_id": "みう"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route01_12.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 37, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "那兩隻松鼠沒有取名字。", "text_idx": 392, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 11, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route01_12.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 38, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "這是美羽學姊決定的，為了不要產生感情。", "text_idx": 389, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 19, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route01_12.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 39, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「快點走啦，混張傢伙……」", "text_idx": 302, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 13, "alt_speaker": "紗凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 380, "voice": "sn0834", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route01_12.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 40, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "乾同學依然背對著，很有她風格地送別松鼠們。", "text_idx": 328, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 21, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route01_12.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 41, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "於是２隻松鼠就像賽跑一樣，一下子就消失在森林中。", "text_idx": 364, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 24, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route01_12.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 42, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "乾同學的肩膀在顫抖。", "text_idx": 330, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 10, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route01_12.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 43, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "她們兩人已經經歷過多少次這樣的離別了呢？", "text_idx": 346, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 20, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route01_12.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 44, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "美羽學姊沒有對乾同學說什麼安慰的話。", "text_idx": 382, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 18, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route01_12.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 45, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "只是輕輕摸了摸她的頭。", "text_idx": 340, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 11, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route01_12.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 46, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「……那個，學姊不會寂寞嗎？」", "text_idx": 266, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 15, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 363, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route01_12.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 47, "speaker": "みう", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「當然會寂寞啊。」", "text_idx": 313, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 9, "alt_speaker": "美羽", "alt_speaker_idx": 381, "voice": "mu0776", "char_id": "みう"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route01_12.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 48, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "學姊的笑容沒有變。", "text_idx": 353, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 9, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route01_12.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 49, "speaker": "みう", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「但是，因為那些孩子比我更寂寞。」", "text_idx": 275, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 17, "alt_speaker": "美羽", "alt_speaker_idx": 381, "voice": "mu0777", "char_id": "みう"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route01_12.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 50, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "學姊溫柔地看了一眼松鼠們消失的森林。", "text_idx": 352, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 18, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route01_12.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 51, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "沒有人稱讚。", "text_idx": 372, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 6, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route01_12.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 52, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "動物們也沒有像童話或傳說那樣回來報恩。", "text_idx": 338, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 19, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route01_12.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 53, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "但是學姊依然挺直嬌小的背脊，守護著森林。", "text_idx": 334, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 20, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route01_12.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 54, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「唔啊，這是誰的手帕？」", "text_idx": 285, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 12, "alt_speaker": "紗凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 380, "voice": "sn0835", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route01_12.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 55, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「是我的……可是，剛才不是妳自己接下的嗎？」", "text_idx": 309, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 22, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 363, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route01_12.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 56, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「……完全不記得。」", "text_idx": 263, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 10, "alt_speaker": "紗凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 380, "voice": "sn0836", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route01_12.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 57, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "應該不是什麼青少年性健忘症。", "text_idx": 355, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 14, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route01_12.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 58, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "只是她整個心都在想松鼠的事情而已。", "text_idx": 339, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 17, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route01_12.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 59, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「你應該沒有在上廁所後用這條手帕吧？」", "text_idx": 277, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 19, "alt_speaker": "紗凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 380, "voice": "sn0837", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route01_12.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 60, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「放心，沒有用。」", "text_idx": 308, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 9, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 363, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route01_12.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 61, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「你居然上完廁所不會洗手嗎！？」", "text_idx": 276, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 16, "alt_speaker": "紗凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 380, "voice": "sn0838", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route01_12.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 62, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「不是那個意思啦！我是說我今天還沒有去過廁所。」", "text_idx": 271, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 24, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 363, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route01_12.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 63, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「感覺你身上有一大堆奇怪的病菌，這條手帕也消毒一下比較好。」", "text_idx": 303, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 30, "alt_speaker": "紗凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 380, "voice": "sn0839", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route01_12.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 64, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "說完後，乾同學把我的手帕放進自己的包包中。", "text_idx": 384, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 21, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route01_12.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 65, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「那個，我的手帕……」", "text_idx": 319, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 11, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 363, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route01_12.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 66, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「消毒後再還你。」", "text_idx": 310, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 9, "alt_speaker": "紗凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 380, "voice": "sn0840", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route01_12.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 67, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "我終於降到跟病菌一樣的等級了嗎？", "text_idx": 359, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 16, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route01_12.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 68, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "……這種成長一點也不高興。", "text_idx": 261, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 13, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route01_12.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 69, "speaker": "みう", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「抱歉喔。我原本也想借手帕給小紗凪的，可以剛才洗手後用過了……」", "text_idx": 305, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 32, "alt_speaker": "美羽", "alt_speaker_idx": 381, "voice": "mu0778", "char_id": "みう"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route01_12.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 70, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「什麼！！！？唔……想要。美羽學姊的含汁手帕！」", "text_idx": 274, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 24, "alt_speaker": "紗凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 380, "voice": "sn0841", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route01_12.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 71, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "含什麼汁液啊……", "text_idx": 341, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 8, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route01_12.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 72, "speaker": "ぱんにゃ", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「嚕～？」", "text_idx": 295, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 5, "alt_speaker": "熊喵", "alt_speaker_idx": 374, "voice": "pn0307", "char_id": "ぱんにゃ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route01_12.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 73, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「熊喵也想要對吧？美羽學姊的含汁手帕。簡稱為美羽汁……啊啊啊、多麼高尚的發音！」", "text_idx": 311, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 40, "alt_speaker": "紗凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 380, "voice": "sn0842", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route01_12.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 74, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "簡略錯地方了吧？", "text_idx": 379, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 8, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route01_12.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 75, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "如果我是熊喵的媽媽，一定會叫牠不可以跟乾同學一起玩。", "text_idx": 350, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 26, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route01_12.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 76, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "不過，美羽汁……", "text_idx": 325, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 8, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route01_12.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 77, "speaker": "みう", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「嘿咻。這個籠子也得清洗乾淨才行呢。」", "text_idx": 294, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 19, "alt_speaker": "美羽", "alt_speaker_idx": 381, "voice": "mu0779", "char_id": "みう"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route01_12.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 78, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「啊啊，那種雜務就交給我吧。」", "text_idx": 288, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 15, "alt_speaker": "紗凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 380, "voice": "sn0843", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route01_12.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 79, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「來，瓜生，你也不要再發呆了！」", "text_idx": 278, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 16, "alt_speaker": "紗凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 380, "voice": "sn0844", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route01_12.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 80, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "看著沒有松鼠的籠子，乾同學強打起精神。", "text_idx": 377, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 19, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route01_12.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 81, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "這就是她的行事風格吧。", "text_idx": 388, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 11, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route01_12.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 82, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「希望有一天，這裡的動物都會離開呢。」", "text_idx": 301, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 19, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 363, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route01_12.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 83, "speaker": "みう", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「嗯。為了這個目標我也要努力才行。」", "text_idx": 291, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 18, "alt_speaker": "美羽", "alt_speaker_idx": 381, "voice": "mu0780", "char_id": "みう"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route01_12.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 84, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "培養出感情的動物離去當然很寂寞。", "text_idx": 345, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 16, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route01_12.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 85, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "但那並不是悲傷的事。", "text_idx": 336, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 10, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route01_12.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 86, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "雖然寂寞，但也是非常美好的事。", "text_idx": 394, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 15, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route01_12.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 87, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「瓜生，我要鎖門了快點出來！」", "text_idx": 312, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 15, "alt_speaker": "紗凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 380, "voice": "sn0845", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route01_12.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 88, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「啊，抱歉抱歉，我在傳郵件給櫻乃。」", "text_idx": 289, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 18, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 363, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route01_12.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 89, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「那種事待會再做啦，快點，我要鎖門了。」", "text_idx": 320, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 20, "alt_speaker": "紗凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 380, "voice": "sn0846", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route01_12.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 90, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "我像個積欠房租的住戶一樣被她趕出來。", "text_idx": 357, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 18, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route01_12.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 91, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "櫻乃發來的郵件只有主旨，沒有內文。", "text_idx": 370, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 17, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route01_12.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 92, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "看來她很不開心我沒叫醒她就出門這件事。", "text_idx": 376, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 19, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route01_12.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 93, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "還是回覆她吧。", "text_idx": 391, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 7, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route01_12.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 94, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "最近也發現她受到安潔影響，在這個多愁善感的年紀身為哥哥實在有點擔心。", "text_idx": 367, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 34, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route01_12.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 95, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "如果是受到乾同學的影響的話……", "text_idx": 351, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 15, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route01_12.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 96, "speaker": "桜乃", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "『我老哥超煩人的欸！』", "text_idx": 321, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 11, "alt_speaker": "櫻乃", "alt_speaker_idx": 369, "voice": "sk1205", "char_id": "桜乃"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route01_12.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 97, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "或許還會在房間裡看漫畫時突然飛踢我。", "text_idx": 361, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 18, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route01_12.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 98, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "……可以的話，我希望她能受到美羽學姊的影響。", "text_idx": 260, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 22, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route01_12.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 99, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「唉……為什麼我要跟你一起回去啊。」", "text_idx": 282, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 18, "alt_speaker": "紗凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 380, "voice": "sn0847", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route01_12.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 100, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「呃，因為到半路為止回家方向相同。」", "text_idx": 281, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 18, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 363, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route01_12.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 101, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "因為美羽學姊去打工了，所以社團只剩下我們。", "text_idx": 343, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 21, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route01_12.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 102, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "走出校門時還被安潔起鬨了幾句，這也是造成她不爽的原因之一。", "text_idx": 385, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 29, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route01_12.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 103, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "安潔當時笑著說。", "text_idx": 354, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 8, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route01_12.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 104, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「真是恩愛夫妻呢」之類的話。", "text_idx": 314, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 14, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route01_12.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 105, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「……對了，你的手沒事了嗎？」", "text_idx": 264, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 15, "alt_speaker": "紗凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 380, "voice": "sn0848", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route01_12.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 106, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「手？」", "text_idx": 304, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 4, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 363, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route01_12.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 107, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「之前不是燒傷了？」", "text_idx": 272, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 10, "alt_speaker": "紗凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 380, "voice": "sn0849", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route01_12.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 108, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「啊啊，沒事喔，而且原本就沒有很嚴重。」", "text_idx": 287, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 20, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 363, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route01_12.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 109, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「…………」", "text_idx": 262, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 6, "alt_speaker": "紗凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 380, "voice": "sn0850", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route01_12.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 110, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「這麼短的時間發生了很多事呢。」", "text_idx": 318, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 16, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 363, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route01_12.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 111, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「在你入社之前都很和平。」", "text_idx": 297, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 13, "alt_speaker": "紗凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 380, "voice": "sn0851", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route01_12.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 112, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「啊哈哈，的確。如果沒有我，乾同學就不會在社團教室裡飛踢了吧。」", "text_idx": 286, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 32, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 363, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route01_12.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 113, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「……那種事哪可能再做第二次。」", "text_idx": 267, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 16, "alt_speaker": "紗凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 380, "voice": "sn0852", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route01_12.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 114, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "乾同學一腳踢起小石子，臉頰氣鼓鼓的。", "text_idx": 327, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 18, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route01_12.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 115, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "雖然我們並肩行走，不過還是保持著生疏的距離。", "text_idx": 395, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 22, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route01_12.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 116, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「先說清楚，我可還沒有認可你是社員喔。」", "text_idx": 279, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 20, "alt_speaker": "紗凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 380, "voice": "sn0853", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route01_12.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 117, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「要怎麼做妳才願意認可？」", "text_idx": 316, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 13, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 363, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route01_12.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 118, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「只要你變成女生，或是再也不靠近美羽學姊半徑１０公尺以內就可以。」", "text_idx": 280, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 33, "alt_speaker": "紗凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 380, "voice": "sn0854", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route01_12.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 119, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "兩個都不可能啦。", "text_idx": 337, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 8, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route01_12.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 120, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「如果辦不到的話……」", "text_idx": 298, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 11, "alt_speaker": "紗凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 380, "voice": "sn0855", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route01_12.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 121, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「唔哇！？」", "text_idx": 284, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 6, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 363, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route01_12.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 122, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "乾同學突然甩動手上提著的包包。", "text_idx": 331, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 15, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route01_12.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 123, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「就盡全力讓我認可試試吧，笨蛋！」", "text_idx": 300, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 17, "alt_speaker": "紗凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 380, "voice": "sn0856", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route01_12.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 124, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "乾同學對我吐舌，然後轉身跑走了。", "text_idx": 329, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 16, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route01_12.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 125, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "連說再見的時間都不留給我。", "text_idx": 390, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 13, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route01_12.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 126, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "不過比起之前，或許稍微有進步了吧。", "text_idx": 324, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 17, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route01_12.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 127, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「喔，櫻乃傳了郵件。」", "text_idx": 290, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 11, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 363, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route01_12.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 128, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "是剛才那封郵件的回覆吧。", "text_idx": 365, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 12, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route01_12.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 129, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "她還是一樣傳了只寫主旨的郵件。", "text_idx": 349, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 15, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route01_12.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 130, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「…………」", "text_idx": 262, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 6, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 363, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route01_12.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 131, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "我的頭痛起來了……", "text_idx": 358, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 9, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
